From: amatiramisu <261696294+amatiramisu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:02:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] win32u, winewayland.drv: DSR desktop modes above the
 native resolution.

Adds desktop modes at area factors of each monitor's native mode
(NVIDIA's 1.20x to 4.00x by default, set with WINE_DSR_FACTORS). The
Vulkan swapchain reduces the image to the monitor with NVIDIA's DSR
filter, a Gaussian in linear light with WINE_DSR_SMOOTHNESS. An asset
directory in WINE_DLDSR_PATH enables NVIDIA's native DL-DSR kernels
for 1.78x and 2.25x SDR downscaling through NVX binary import, with DSR
as the setup fallback. Monitor lookups preserve windows below 96 DPI.
---
